></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"block\" unselectable=\"on\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Use Euler's method with two steps of equal size to approximate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sat, Oct 17th @ 12:00 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:18</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
